# Neural Search Engine

Production-grade neural search engine with Cerebras Inference API, Modal.com GPU compute, Dragonfly cache, and KDB+ analytics.

## Architecture

- Gateway: Zig HTTP/2 + SSE server
- LLM: Cerebras API (Qwen filter, GPT-OSS, GLM)
- GPU Compute: Modal.com (B200 GPUs)
- Cache: Dragonfly (RESP3)
- Analytics: KDB+/Q tick database
- Storage: S3-compatible
- Metadata: PostgreSQL

## Prerequisites

- Zig 0.12+
- Terra compiler
- Futhark 0.25+
- Bend compiler
- .NET 8.0
- Python 3.11+
- Docker & Docker Compose
- CMake 3.20+
- CUDA 12.3+
- Modal CLI
- KDB+ 4.0+

## Environment Variables

```bash
export CEREBRAS_API_KEY="your-key"
export CEREBRAS_BASE_URL="https://api.cerebras.ai/v1"
export MODAL_TOKEN_ID="your-id"
export MODAL_TOKEN_SECRET="your-secret"
export DRAGONFLY_URL="redis://localhost:6379"
export POSTGRES_DSN="postgresql://user:pass@localhost/neural_search"
export S3_ENDPOINT="https://s3.amazonaws.com"
export S3_ACCESS_KEY="your-key"
export S3_SECRET_KEY="your-secret"
export KDB_HOST="localhost"
export KDB_PORT="5001"


 Build

bash
./scripts/build_all.sh


Builds all components:
 Zig gateway → build/bin/gateway
 Terra preprocessing → build/lib/libpreprocessing.so
 Futhark vector libs → build/lib/*.so
 Bend graph binaries → build/bin/{pagerank,link_analysis,clustering,kg}
 Spiral training → build/bin/*

 Deploy

bash
./scripts/deploy_modal.sh


Deploys Modal functions:
 embedding_encode
 vector_search
 graph_compute
 batch_indexer (cron)

Start gateway:
bash
./build/bin/gateway


Start crawler:
bash
cd src/crawler && inko run main.ik


 Monitoring

bash
./scripts/start_monitoring.sh


Starts:
 KDB+ tick database (port 5001)
 Grafana (port 3000)
 Dragonfly (port 6379)

 Testing

bash
./scripts/run_tests.sh


Runs:
 Unit tests (Zig, Inko, Futhark, Bend)
 Integration tests (endtoend flow)
 Performance benchmarks
 Stress tests

 API

 POST /search

bash
curl "http://localhost:8080/search?q=quantum+computing&deep_research=false" \
  -H "Accept: text/event-stream"


Response: SSE stream


event: chunk
data: {"type":"text","content":"Quantum computing..."}

event: chunk
data: {"type":"text","content":"uses quantum bits..."}


 GET /health

bash
curl http://localhost:8080/health


Response: {"status":"ok"}

 GET /stats

bash
curl http://localhost:8080/stats


Response: System statistics JSON

 Production Deployment

1. Set all environment variables
2. Build: make all
3. Deploy Modal: ./scripts/deploy_modal.sh
4. Start services: docker-compose up -d
5. Run migrations: psql $POSTGRES_DSN < schema.sql
6. Start monitoring: ./scripts/start_monitoring.sh

